{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded. Hunted. Not Alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four friends head into the woods for a fun camping trip\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after their vehicle is stripped for parts overnight, they're left with nothing but fear and a flickering flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/6b807962fabfebeeea836dc052820860.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/6b807962fabfebeeea836dc052820860.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/6b807962fabfebeeea836dc052820860.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest isn\u2019t empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night brings new horrors\u2014twisted traps, shifting shadows, and creatures that hunt without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/fff2d0574c35b0df473d3223e4fd1dbf.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1400 height=788 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/fff2d0574c35b0df473d3223e4fd1dbf.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/fff2d0574c35b0df473d3223e4fd1dbf.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mailbox in the middle of the woods? A couch nailed to a tree? The forest is full of strange sights\u2014and stranger threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/e19f851074547e20b51c12def8b6800e.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/e19f851074547e20b51c12def8b6800e.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/e19f851074547e20b51c12def8b6800e.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal encounters will test your sanity. Some will make you laugh. Others... you\u2019ll wish you never saw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/a02b9a60f6d5af8e44da137b1bdbca6c.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/a02b9a60f6d5af8e44da137b1bdbca6c.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/a02b9a60f6d5af8e44da137b1bdbca6c.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even rewards can be a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That treasure chest? It might bite back. Every decision carries risk. Greed could be your undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong> is Never Simple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for <strong>food</strong>, search for <strong>water</strong>, and locate missing <strong>vehicle parts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your hunger, thirst, and mental state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together\u2014or fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic map</strong> that changes every playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events, shifting weather, and unscripted chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two games are ever the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape\u2026 or Endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the parts and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you simply try to last\u00a0one\u00a0more\u00a0night?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822530?t=1758448510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/673cbd5d0c2e7cf45800a4885672493c4ab7464d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758448510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/cad82bc42f74f22de38f4f7555830c7a0d81fc70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758448510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/cad82bc42f74f22de38f4f7555830c7a0d81fc70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758448510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes intense horror elements and suspenseful scenarios that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players may encounter:\r\n\r\nFrightening creatures, disturbing imagery, and sudden jump scares\r\n\r\nDepictions of violence, including characters being attacked or killed by monsters\r\n\r\nThemes of isolation, fear, and survival under extreme stress\r\n\r\nWhile the game does not include sexual content, nudity, or depictions of sexual assault, it does portray dark themes that may be emotionally intense for some players.\r\n\r\nThere is no representation of drug or alcohol use, and no self-harm or suicide is depicted."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded. Hunted. Not Alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four friends head into the woods for a fun camping trip\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after their vehicle is stripped for parts overnight, they're left with nothing but fear and a flickering flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/6b807962fabfebeeea836dc052820860.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/6b807962fabfebeeea836dc052820860.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/6b807962fabfebeeea836dc052820860.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest isn\u2019t empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night brings new horrors\u2014twisted traps, shifting shadows, and creatures that hunt without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/fff2d0574c35b0df473d3223e4fd1dbf.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1400 height=788 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/fff2d0574c35b0df473d3223e4fd1dbf.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/fff2d0574c35b0df473d3223e4fd1dbf.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mailbox in the middle of the woods? A couch nailed to a tree? The forest is full of strange sights\u2014and stranger threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/e19f851074547e20b51c12def8b6800e.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/e19f851074547e20b51c12def8b6800e.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/e19f851074547e20b51c12def8b6800e.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal encounters will test your sanity. Some will make you laugh. Others... you\u2019ll wish you never saw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/a02b9a60f6d5af8e44da137b1bdbca6c.poster.avif?t=1758448510\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/a02b9a60f6d5af8e44da137b1bdbca6c.webm?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/a02b9a60f6d5af8e44da137b1bdbca6c.mp4?t=1758448510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even rewards can be a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That treasure chest? It might bite back. Every decision carries risk. Greed could be your undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong> is Never Simple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for <strong>food</strong>, search for <strong>water</strong>, and locate missing <strong>vehicle parts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your hunger, thirst, and mental state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together\u2014or fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic map</strong> that changes every playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events, shifting weather, and unscripted chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two games are ever the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape\u2026 or Endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the parts and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you simply try to last\u00a0one\u00a0more\u00a0night?</p>","developers":["Studio Wombo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/97b4